SOLUTION 1 River Water
    pH 6.0
    temp 25
    units mg/l
    Cl 10
    Na 10
    Alkalinity 0 charge

SOLUTION 2 Seawater
    pH 8.1
    temp 25
    units mg/l
    Cl 19000
    Na 19000
    Alkalinity 0 charge

MIX 1
    1 0.7
    2 0.3

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file solution.sel
    -activities H+
    -pH
END
